{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/7aa154e0212d315c9eb195c3c12575f9.poster.avif?t=1773204122\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/7aa154e0212d315c9eb195c3c12575f9.webm?t=1773204122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/7aa154e0212d315c9eb195c3c12575f9.mp4?t=1773204122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embark on a journey, freely exploring a vast and breathtaking world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient landscapes of YARETA seem frozen in time, with towering mountains and strange, vibrant creatures and plants thriving in peaceful isolation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/89c561df358975de5bb6739825fe4b82.poster.avif?t=1773204122\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/89c561df358975de5bb6739825fe4b82.webm?t=1773204122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/89c561df358975de5bb6739825fe4b82.mp4?t=1773204122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encounter majestic, awe-inspiring creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world\u2019s rich ecosystems hold countless surprises, with unexpected interactions unfolding as you meet the land\u2019s fantastic creatures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/1c481a6795a24239728f2a5c12a645f2.poster.avif?t=1773204122\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/1c481a6795a24239728f2a5c12a645f2.webm?t=1773204122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/1c481a6795a24239728f2a5c12a645f2.mp4?t=1773204122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Connect to the Sky Rope and take in the beauty of the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond traveling on foot, your unique ability to glide with the Sky Rope lets you experience the land\u2019s beauty from an entirely new perspective. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/482cee724d09b7582613983eb2aef4b7.poster.avif?t=1773204122\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/482cee724d09b7582613983eb2aef4b7.webm?t=1773204122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/482cee724d09b7582613983eb2aef4b7.mp4?t=1773204122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interact with the world and let your curiosity guide you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brave the unknown, following the mysteries of the land as you uncover secrets hidden within the ancient world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230380/extras/dcc9250dc19813587c6d8dd6e0b6913a.poster.avif?t=1773204122\" width=500 heig